  "featureBankImportDesc": "Reads the bank's statement files (camt.053/054, MT940, CODA, OFX/QFX or a spreadsheet) into the space, each movement once, and suggests the invoice each payment settles by the QR or RF reference printed on it, its number or its amount; a person confirms every match, and the rest stays in a work list. A payment out reconciles a payment already recorded as made.",
