  "featureReportDesignExchangeDesc": "Every report design can be written out as one self-describing file and read back in. The file carries the design plus what its fields mean, the markup it accepts and the placeholders that exist, so a person or a tool can edit it outside the app and hand it back. A file for another report, or from a newer version, is refused with the reason. Off: designs are only editable in the designer.",
